{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"860e63df45cac8f6d8de34fbfa7a8c7e302b9103bc30a8ed2e7d367f2c849df9","ja":"（やっぱり、改めて見ると、\nまつりさんの演技ってすごいな……！）","zh":"（重新再看一遍，果然还是觉得\n茉莉小姐的演技好厉害啊……！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d892350f81410b7d12da71dc3b6bb2b1a56699ff6fc167207f150aa51fb33390","ja":"桃子ちゃん。そんなに眉間にシワを寄せてたら\nクセになってしまうのですよ？","zh":"桃子。要是总是这样皱着眉头，\n会变成习惯的哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b72f02533431714bba7cc6fb88ea17f5df99a39ca1e8e3a8ead327b1669f7f79","ja":"ま、まつりさん！？　どうしてここに！？","zh":"茉、茉莉小姐！？你怎么会在这里！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"94c1621d4100f2d53030a6a87a994a2ae6abf6995e1cac6ee71e054b1760d112","ja":"桃子ちゃんが、さっきからずーっと怖い顔を\nしてるので、気になっていたのです。","zh":"桃子从刚才起就一直板着脸，\n所以我很在意呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6af3f1e85416171b16e9e5c8b40487378832e1f89122b8ea31f7bb8192bbe0f7","ja":"それに姫のこと、じーっと見てましたよね？\n姫に何かお話があるのです？","zh":"而且你还一直盯着公主看对吧？\n是有什么话想对公主说吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b0e32bf61b765f17214deed5186e33db03e575152bf8225d81707eb23aa56dfa","ja":"その……この前の公演でまつりさんを見て\n演技力が高いんじゃないかって思って。","zh":"那个……看了上次公演中的茉莉小姐，\n我觉得她的演技其实挺厉害的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"db562e47d83e259d2dc97c6a488a4f491ad6a77690c8b9aa0556a7a8bef5de59","ja":"それを確認したかったの。\n……こそこそして、ごめんなさい。","zh":"我只是想确认一下那个。\n……鬼鬼祟祟的，对不起。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3134a16ba2757040d1c279dcc4f5d0577356749fc4988dc287609c246db2130c","ja":"なるほど、そういうことだったのですね！\n謎が解けてスッキリしたのです！","zh":"原来是这么回事啊！\n解开谜团之后整个人都舒畅了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4ce5c3c3063bfbd99ec14b5843ec22850dc37f2f9297073a21473890357b3ea3","ja":"それに桃子ちゃんに演技を褒めてもらえるなんて、\n姫はとってもうれしいのですよ♪","zh":"而且能被桃子夸奖演技，\n公主非常开心哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"56938259392b208c79a55c4beaf8debf29b42788283c3519bac0834a8d4c40fd","ja":"う、うん……でもね！","zh":"嗯、嗯……但是呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d202f246d99f17b0edf082a533ef8b94d3485c12d75b81c9937153b5a9b8fdc1","ja":"桃子は負けないよ！\n海美さんにも、まつりさんにも、絶対に！","zh":"桃子是不会输的！\n无论是海美，还是茉莉，绝对都不会输的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a573f23ec1fab942e97688ecad9c7ccb292dc3212ae2408369a05287d2b9b07f","ja":"……ふふっ。桃子ちゃんはまっすぐですね。","zh":"……呵呵。桃子很率真呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1408.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"2359622151af670b53872651aaa2f476f822df47e5b5094b69e4eb43479ee074","ja":"でも、姫も負けないのですよ！\nこれからも一緒に頑張るのです！","zh":"但是，公主也不会认输的哦！\n今后也要一起加油哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
